2. Vendored JSON schemas — Apache-2.0 / OASIS Royalty-Free
================================================================

The project vendors authoritative JSON Schema documents from the
following upstream specifications for runtime emission gating
(`src/schemas/validate.ts` compiles each via ajv and validates the
serialised SBOM/SARIF document before atomic write).

--- SPDX 2.3 ---
File: src/schemas/spdx-2.3.json
Source: https://github.com/spdx/spdx-spec
License: Apache License, Version 2.0
Steward: The Linux Foundation / SPDX Project
The file is vendored verbatim from the upstream SPDX repository;
the retrieval timestamp is recorded in the schema's $id field.

--- CycloneDX 1.5 ---
Files:
  src/schemas/cyclonedx-1.5.json
  src/schemas/cyclonedx-jsf-0.82.schema.json
  src/schemas/cyclonedx-spdx.schema.json
Source: https://github.com/CycloneDX/specification
License: Apache License, Version 2.0
Steward: OWASP Foundation / CycloneDX Project
The supplementary `cyclonedx-jsf-0.82.schema.json` (JSON Signature
Format) and `cyclonedx-spdx.schema.json` (SPDX-licensing subset) are
referenced by `cyclonedx-1.5.json` via `$ref`; vendoring them
verbatim keeps schema resolution offline-deterministic.

--- SARIF 2.1.0 ---
File: src/schemas/sarif-2.1.0.json
Source: https://docs.oasis-open.org/sarif/sarif/v2.1.0/
License: OASIS Royalty-Free (per OASIS IPR Policy 10.2.1)
Steward: OASIS Open / SARIF TC
The file is vendored from the OASIS-published v2.1.0 specification.

